{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a KING - a being with the power to travel through dimensions to save corrupted realms. Fight hordes of enemies, find the HEARTS of the KINGS, unlock new characters and discover the secrets of each dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/0c3e8430dc747a23f2295e3256bde426.poster.avif?t=1772987682\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/0c3e8430dc747a23f2295e3256bde426.webm?t=1772987682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/0c3e8430dc747a23f2295e3256bde426.mp4?t=1772987682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dimensions have sunk into chaos, corrupted by dark forces. Only you can cleanse them. Each realm has its own atmosphere, style and sound. Unlock the dimensions, face their challenges and confront the KINGS who rule over them. Will you triumph or perish in darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/1423e6d29b341b88e7b750ec9797df75.poster.avif?t=1772987682\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/1423e6d29b341b88e7b750ec9797df75.webm?t=1772987682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/1423e6d29b341b88e7b750ec9797df75.mp4?t=1772987682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect COOKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced roguelite action gameplay with a variety of enemies and challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters with unique abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different worlds, each with its own style, atmosphere and music.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995290?t=1772987682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995290?t=1772987682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772987682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772987682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a KING - a being with the power to travel through dimensions to save corrupted realms. Fight hordes of enemies, find the HEARTS of the KINGS, unlock new characters and discover the secrets of each dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/0c3e8430dc747a23f2295e3256bde426.poster.avif?t=1772987682\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995290/extras/0c3e8430dc747a23f2295e3256bde426.webm?t=17